{"id":"u_nico","lemma":"único","pos":"adj","rank":282,"glosses":["only; single; sole","unique, one-of-a-kind","solitary, alone, only one(s)"],"ipa":"/ˈuniko/","forms":{"feminine":"única","masculinePlural":"únicos","femininePlural":"únicas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/19/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-%C3%BAnico.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom es hijo único.","en":"Tom is an only child.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/67075"},{"text":"Es mi única oportunidad.","en":"It's my only chance.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449634"},{"text":"Éramos los únicos invitados.","en":"We were the only guests.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/586604"},{"text":"Las únicas respuestas útiles son las que plantean nuevas preguntas.","en":"The only useful answers are those that raise new questions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587251"},{"text":"Era mi único amigo.","en":"He was my only friend.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/637151"}]}